# EventRelay Cursor Rules

## Vercel context
- Prefer Vercel AI Gateway for web-side AI fallbacks when `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` is configured.
- Reference the full Vercel docs context at https://vercel.com/docs/llms-full.txt when generating or reviewing Vercel-specific code.
- Preview deployments may require `VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET` for E2E access.

## Critical paths
- `apps/web/src/app/api/chat/route.ts` preserves the backend proxy path and only falls back to AI Gateway when `BACKEND_URL` is unset.
- `apps/web/src/app/api/video/generate/route.ts` is rate-limited and intended for experimental Veo generation only.
- `apps/web/src/app/api/pipeline/stream/route.ts` is the long-running SSE route with elevated Vercel max duration.
